diagnostics/case-syntax.em:6:12: this arm has a block, but the arms above it use `then`
      when 2 {
             ^
A `case` either runs a block for each arm or produces a value from each with `then`. Write every arm the same way.
diagnostics/case-syntax.em:14:5: nothing can follow the `else` arm
      when 1 {
      ^^^^
`else` catches everything the arms above it did not, so it comes last. Move this arm above it.
diagnostics/case-syntax.em:19:14: a `case` without a subject takes one condition per `when`
